---
title: Vesper
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, gin]
source: Classic cocktail, number 30 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

In a #cocktail shaker{}(with ice), pour @gin{3%fl_oz}, @vodka{1%fl_oz} and @Lillet Blanc{0.5%fl_oz}. Shake until ice cold, and strain into a #coupe glass{}(well chilled). Garnish with a long, thin @lemon peel{1%twist}.

> From Ian Fleming's Casino Royale (1953), which asks for it shaken.
